, "headline": "Jharkhand State <b>Electricity</b> Board has\n\nregistered a case of <b>theft</b>.\n \n 5.        Under the <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003 , &quot;cases of <b>theft</b> of <b>electricity</b> ... <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003 is under Part XII, which deals with &quot;investigation\n\nand enforcement&quot; whereas, the <b>theft</b> of <b>electricity</b> under  <b>Section</b> <b>135</b>", "docsize": 11569, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Jharkhand High Court", "author": "V Singh", "authorEncoded": "virender-singh"}, {"tid": 126976874, "catids": [107], "doctype": 1004, "publishdate": "2019-12-04", "authorid": 453, "bench": [453], "title": "Usama Najmuddin Kazi vs The State Of Maharasthra on 4 December, 2019", "numcites": 4, "numcitedby": 1, "headline": "concern with the alleged <b>theft</b> of <b>electricity</b>. Thus, the applicant\n\n      cannot be prosecuted for the offence punishable under  <b>Section</b> <b>135</b> ... offence of <b>theft</b>.\n\nWhoever dishonestly commits <b>theft</b> of <b>electricity</b>, by various means, is liable\n\nto be punished under  <b>Section</b> <b>135</b> . Any person who commits <b>theft</b>", "docsize": 13058, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Bombay High Court", "author": "N J Jamadar", "authorEncoded": "n-j-jamadar", "citation": "AIRONLINE 2019 BOM 2239"}, {"tid": 178198653, "catids": [7], "doctype": 1008, "publishdate": "2017-05-19", "authorid": 24, "bench": [24], "title": "Saurabh Agrawal And Another vs State Of U.P.And Others on 19 May, 2017", "numcites": 14, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "company. On the basis of the check report the <b>theft</b> of <b>electricity</b> under  <b>section</b> <b>135</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act, 2003 offence was said ... attract  <b>section</b> <b>135</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b> Act 2003 and at the most  <b>section</b> 126  sub-clause 6(b) of the  <b>Electricity</b>", "docsize": 30220, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Allahabad High Court", "author": "A S Chauhan", "authorEncoded": "a-s-chauhan"}, {"tid": 169661543, "catids": [1, 20], "doctype": 1017, "publishdate": "2011-09-13", "authorid": 829, "bench": [829], "title": "Dy vs Himashubhai on 13 September, 2011", "numcites": 8, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>electricity</b>, the petitioner company has lodged criminal complaint\nagainst the respondent company under  <b>Section</b> <b>135</b>  of the <b>Electricity</b>\nAct, 2003 for offence of <b>theft</b> ... company has found that the respondent was committing <b>theft</b> of\n<b>electricity</b>. Therefore, the proceedings under  <b>Section</b> <b>135</b>  of the Act\nhave been instituted.  \n \n \n\n \n\n\n \n\n 13.\t\tBefore", "docsize": 35225, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Gujarat High Court", "author": "K M Thaker", "authorEncoded": "k-m-thaker"}, {"tid": 52623979, "catids": null, "doctype": 1019, "publishdate": "2025-08-08", "authorid": 964, "bench": [964, 954], "title": "Jharkhand Urja Vikas Nigam Limited vs M/S. Himadri Steel Pvt. Ltd. Having Its ... on 8 August, 2025", "numcites": 31, "numcitedby": 0, "headline": "<b>Section</b> <b>135</b>  and  <b>Section</b> 154  of the Act, 2003 also needs to be\n\nmade herein, which is being quoted hereinbelow-:\n\n             &quot;<b>135</b>.<b>Theft</b>       of     <b>Electricity</b> ... referred as under:-\n\n            &quot;A11: <b>Theft</b> and Unauthorised Use of <b>Electricity</b>\n          <b>Theft</b> of <b>Electricity</b>\n          11.1 Whenever a case of <b>theft</b> of energy is detected", "docsize": 96556, "fragment": true, "docsource": "Jharkhand High Court", "author": "S N Prasad", "authorEncoded": "s-n-prasad"}], "found": "141 - 150 of 3932", "encodedformInput": "%22section%20135%22%20electricity%20theft%20doctypes%3Ahighcourts"}